{"route":"/eti-log/","source":"https://enerman.in/eti-log/","title":"Data Logger for Solar Power Plants | EnerMAN Technologies","description":"ETi-LOG data logger for solar power plants: Modbus RTU/TCP, minute-wise data stored at site for up to 30 days, sends to cloud or local server.","heading":"ETi-LOG: IoT data logger for solar plants","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"IoT datalogger","links":[]},{"type":"h1","text":"ETi-LOG: IoT data logger for solar plants","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"ETi-LOG reads your plant equipment over Modbus RTU or TCP, stores minute-wise data at site for up to 30 days, and sends it to a local server, the cloud, or both.","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"Book a 20-minute walkthrough","links":[{"label":"Book a 20-minute walkthrough","href":"https://enerman.in/inquiry-form/"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Download the datasheet","links":[{"label":"Download the datasheet","href":"https://enerman.in/#datasheet"}]},{"type":"image","src":"/assets/ad1beae043-eman-eti-log-unit.webp","original":"https://enerman.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/eman-eti-log-unit.webp","alt":"ETi-LOG IoT datalogger, DIN-rail unit","width":557,"height":641},{"type":"p","text":"3+ GW","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"GW Portfolio","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"700+","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"Solar Plants","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"300+","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"Customers","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"10+","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"Countries","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"What it does","links":[]},{"type":"h2","text":"Collects, processes and sends the data of all your PV plant equipment","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"It connects to inverters, weather stations, multi-function meters, breakers, transformers and other sensors, and feeds ETi-SOL in the cloud or ETi-EDGE on your own server.","links":[]},{"type":"h3","text":"Local storage","links":[]},{"type":"p","text":"Stores minute-wise data at site for up to 30 days, so an internet failure loses no d